### Create a new patient via Go API Gateway
POST http://localhost:8080/api/patients/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer

{
  "firstName": "Israel",
  "lastName": "Israeli",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "medicalHistorySummary": "Healthy patient, no known allergies."
}

### Get all patients via Go API Gateway
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/HealthcareRealm/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=api-gateway&grant_type=password&username=doctor_osher&password=1234